The dmsdos filesystem, version 0.7.5, has just been released.

It supports the following compressed filesystems:

        - doublespace/drivespace (msdos 6.x)
        - doublespace/drivespace (win95)
        - drivespace 3 (win95 with plus pack)
        - stacker version 3 and 4

All of them are supported read-write, but there are currently some
restrictions for drivespace 3 (no support for ultra compression) and
stacker 3 (write access without compression).

New in this release:

        - again speed improvement
        - stacker 4 compression
        - bugfixes, of course

Please note that the dmsdos filesystem is still beta test code, but
first non-beta release may come out soon.

If you can't find it on the ftp servers listed below, try the incoming
directories.

Merry Christmas and a happy new year -

  Frank

