I have created a mailing list for those who do coding in Linux (or those
who might be interested). The list is "general purpose" in that any and
all aspects of programming in Linux are covered. The list is not
necessarily tied to C/C++ - feel free to talk about Tcl, Perl, Python,
whatever.

No question is too stupid. No question is too trivial. Linux is
fantastic environment to program in, let's support each other.

There are two version of the list, the regular list and the list in
digest form. To subscribe send mail to majordomo@netsteps.com, no
subject line, in the body either put:

	subscribe linuxpro
- -or-
	subscribe linuxpro-digest

Majordomo will dutifully send you a confirmation message. Follow the
directions in the message to complete the subscription process.

I look forward to seeing your participation.

Regards,
