be found at ftp://ftp.ihg.uni-duisburg.de/Linux/pc537 and the Linux Lab
Server project (ftp://ftp.llp.fu-berlin.de/linux/LINUX-LAB/CONTROLLERS).

Pc537 is a driver for Feger + Co's 537(LWL) PC-Addin boards for Siemens
80C537 or 80C517A microcontroller chips. It should run with their 535
card as well.

Pc537 was developed under linux 1.2.13 and modules 1.3.57 and put under
