Subject: fetchmail 2.1 - a full-featured POP2/POP3/APOP/IMAP client
Date: 1996/12/10
Message-ID: <cola-quinlan-850184350-22832-0@proton.pathname.com>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 203242517
