I have released a new patch level of Wget, the non-interactive
web-mirroring utility.  Thanks to numerous people who proposed features
and submitted bug reports.

Thanks to Karsten Thygesen, Wget now has its own mailing list for
discussion and announcements; to subscribe, send mail to
<URL:mailto:wget-request@sunsite.auc.dk> with the magic word `subscribe'
in the subject.

