Good day! I am releasing a package I put together a couple months ago.
Install-Jet is a package that will allow you to print text files and
Postscript files on a HP Deskjet printer using the lpr command. A
shell script is included in the package so installation should (at
least in theory) be an easy task.

I have uploaded the package to sunsite in the Incoming directory. The
file is called dj-printcap.tar.gz. Hopefully in the future the file
will be moved to the /pub/Linux/system/Printing directory. An
alternate way to get the file is through the WWW at:

      http://eddie.cis.uoguelph.ca/~tburgess/dj-printcap.tar.gz

The LSM entry is included below:

